      "value": [
        "PlayerAttackSystem clears queued attacks on death. A collider must match the critter property and must not have flying property for this call.",
        "The shared GetDamageInfo path requires its runtime component assumptions and applies immunity, damage calculation and reduction; base 1 is not guaranteed final damage.",
        "PlayerController passes the attacker god-mode lookup as the positional isExplosive argument after showDamageNumber=false; ClientSystem godMode stays its default false. That isExplosive value also reaches the downstream damage/pull-loot parameters.",
        "PlayerGhost target follows RegisterPlayerHit and returns before the non-player EntityUtility.DealDamage path; do not infer component composition from the critter property."
      ]
